[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0010","text":"啊……对了，甘奈酱\n你试着动一下右边的肩膀……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0020","text":"好～！\n……这样，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0030","text":"啊……果然\n衣服上的装饰有点快掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0040","text":"稍等一下哦，\n我去拿针线来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0050","text":"哇……！可以吗……！？\n谢谢你！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0056","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0060","text":"缝好了！\n……嗯，这样就没事了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0070","text":"千雪姐的手艺\n真的好厉害啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0080","text":"咦……？\n感觉肩膀比之前轻了一些……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0090","text":"我稍微配合着甘奈酱的体型缝了一下\n如果活动起来更方便就好了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0100","text":"这种事也能做到啊！嘿嘿\n多亏了千雪姐，甘奈力量UP！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
